==Battleground==
*3 [[Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*4 [[Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*7 [[Snache]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*7 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

